  "question": {
    "text": "A projectile fired at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> to the ground is observed to be at same height at time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> after projection, during its flight. The speed of projection of the projectile is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.<br />(Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "80",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c39c65b5-1a8d-4777-af56-791aef02a91b.png\" style=\"width: 434px; height: 187px;\" /></p><p>The time taken to reach maximum height is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></math>.</p><p>The total time of flight is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>.</p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
    "image": null
